  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675387/ET-Bureau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ET Bureau</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Updated On Sep 13, 2026 at 09:41 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                            <li>\n                                                        \n                                                            \n                                                                Read by \n                                                            \n                                                            100 Professionals\n                                                        \n                                                    </li>\n                                                                                    </ul>\n                                    \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>New Delhi: <a href=\"/tag/marengo+asia+hospitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Marengo Asia Hospitals</a> has raised ₹400 crore from <a href=\"/tag/leapfrog+investments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LeapFrog Investments</a> to expand its <a href=\"/tag/hospital+network\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hospital network</a>, the company said in a statement.Marengo is backed by Samara Capital and the family offices of Godrej and <a href=\"/tag/havells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Havells</a>. \"Our partnership with Marengo reinforces LeapFrog's commitment to building high-quality healthcare platforms across Asia and Africa,\" said Biju Mohandas, partner and global healthcare lead at LeapFrog Investments. The statement did not disclose details of the valuation.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>ET had first reported on April 14 that Marengo was looking to raise ₹500 crore by selling a 10% stake at a valuation of ₹5,000 crore. The stake sale was expected to precede a potential <a href=\"/tag/initial+public+offering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">initial public offering</a>.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Marengo operates five hospitals in India and has a strategic partnership in Saudi Arabia. It has a capacity of 2,000 beds and operates facilities across the National Capital Region, Gujarat and Rajasthan. Its revenues are said to be in the ₹1,000-1,200 crore range.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The proceeds will be used to double bed capacity to more than 4,000 over the next two years, according to Samara Capital managing director <a href=\"/tag/abhishek+kabra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Abhishek Kabra</a>, who also serves as chairman of Marengo Asia Hospitals. The company was founded by former Indian Army surgeon Raajiv Singhal, whose experience in the private sector includes senior roles at Fortis Hospitals, Care Hospitals and Sakra Hospital.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                    \n\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675387/ET-Bureau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ET Bureau</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Sep 13, 2026 at 09:41 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Sep 13, 2026 at 09:37 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n        